# Last three property families that fell through the platform catch-all to
# default_prop and showed up as boot-time denials.  None of them is owned by any
# property_contexts file on the device, so the names can be labelled here; the
# platform's own `allow domain exported_default_prop:file` then covers every
# reader, which is what these need: the GPU ones are read by apps as well as by
# the vendor daemons, and the camera ones by both the vendor camera HALs and the
# system camera processes they are loaded into.  All three are read-only debug
# or feature switches today - no domain can set default_prop, so relabelling
# cannot take a write away - and vendor_init keeps the set it has on
# exported_default_prop.
#
#   debuglog.drv, debuglog.drv.fdvt_drv, debuglog.drv.owe_drv
#       the legacy (unprefixed) form of MTK's log switches.  libcamdrv_isp.so,
#       libdip_drv.so, libmtkcam_fdv/owe/twin.so and friends reference the
#       family, and camerahalserver (mtk_hal_camera) is the domain that got the
#       read denied.
#   persist.glt.version
#       ARM's GL conformance test switch, literal in /vendor/lib64/egl/
#       libGLES_meow.so.
#   persist.meow.ddk_lock
#       built at run time by the same MEOW layer, so the prefix - not the single
#       name - is what is labelled.
#   sipa.timer, sipa.pvdd.limit, sipa.proc.time, sipa.pcm.save, sipa.hal.debug
#       the debug switches of the SIA81xx speaker amplifier, read by
#       /odm/lib64/libsixth.so inside the audio HAL (hal_audio_default, thread
#       "writer") every time the speaker path is brought up - libc logs
#       `Access denied finding property "sipa.<x>"` for each one.  That library
#       is the only file on the device that references the family.
debuglog.                                                   u:object_r:exported_default_prop:s0
persist.glt.                                                u:object_r:exported_default_prop:s0
persist.meow.                                               u:object_r:exported_default_prop:s0
sipa.                                                       u:object_r:exported_default_prop:s0

